    <string name="wake_help_text">Linux: busctl set-property org.bluez /org/bluez/hci0/dev_XX_XX_XX_XX_XX_XX org.bluez.Device1 WakeAllowed b false (XX_… is this phone\'s address from bluetoothctl devices), or write disabled to the Bluetooth controller\'s power/wakeup in /sys.\n\nWindows: Device Manager → Bluetooth adapter → Power Management → uncheck “Allow this device to wake the computer”.\n\nmacOS: System Settings → Bluetooth → Advanced → uncheck “Allow Bluetooth devices to wake this computer” (wording varies by version).</string>
